"{\n  \"reasoning\": \"Given the 100\u202f\u00b5W power limit (Itail \u2264\u202f15\u202f\u00b5A) the achievable gm per input device (~150\u202f\u00b5S) yields a GBW \u2248\u202f5\u202fMHz, far below the 100\u202fMHz requirement. Therefore the design is limited by power and cannot meet the GBW spec; the following sizes use the maximum allowable tail current while keeping Vov\u22480.2\u202fV for reasonable over\u2011drive.\",\n  \"W1_um\": 0.55,\n  \"L1_um\": 0.28,\n  \"W3_um\": 1.10,\n  \"L3_um\": 0.28,\n  \"W5_um\": 0.55,\n  \"L5_um\": 0.28,\n  \"Itail_uA\": 15.0\n}"